-+The implementation satisfies all UI, UX, responsive design, whitespace rhythm, accessibility, and strict CSP requirements outlined in `docs/ARCHITECTURE_AND_PRODUCT_SPEC.md` (Sections 8.1, 8.2, 6.1, 6.2, 5.4).
