-++
-++- Ticket: `KANBA-127` (`KB-P4-08`): `[Phase 4 / MCP] /mcp/docs surface: 6 knowledge & sticky tools`
-++- Auditor: `arch-reviewer` (Systems Architect & API Specialist Gate Auditor)
