-
-- Ticket: KANBA-133 (KB-P4-15)
-- Title: Dynamic MCP Connection Scoping: Global (/mcp/{s}), Workspace (/w/{slug}) & Project (/w/{slug}/p/{key}) Routes + Header Narrowing
